<title>FRANCE: Thomson-CSF gets French naval contracts.</title>
<headline>Thomson-CSF gets French naval contracts.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>French defence electronics firm Thomson-CSF said on Monday it had been awarded two naval communications contracts by the French defence ministry.</p>
<p>The contracts concerned the OMAR-HF programme, modernising French fleet systems and maintaining interoperability with the communications systems of other NATO navies, Thomson-CSF said in a statement.</p>
<p>It did not put a value on the contracts.</p>
</text>
